      "title": "Executive Director recently bought ₹102k worth of stock",
      "body": "On the 27th of March, Ankitkumar Shah bought around 26k shares on-market at roughly ₹4.00 per share. This transaction amounted to less than 1% of their direct individual holding at the time of the trade. This was the largest purchase by an insider in the last 3 months. Insiders have collectively bought ₹167k more in shares than they have sold in the last 12 months.",
