      "date": "2026-01-26T00:26:34.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.06 (vs ₹0.05 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.06 (up from ₹0.05 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹220.7m (down 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹7.70m (up 15% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.5% (up from 2.6% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 8% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 5% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
